13:- **Compose seeds at load time.** The `seed` service runs `app seed`, anchored at now. The data is fresh whenever the stack is seeded, so the counts below hold for a reviewer running it a week from now as well as today.
14:- **Counts do not depend on the anchor.** Rules are evaluated relative to `asOf` (for example "cart_add within 30 days"). Because the data is relative to its own anchor, a rule gives the same count for any anchor. A test generates the same seed at two anchors and checks every offset and the example counts are equal.
